{"id":3705,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/this-that-these-those/","parentId":540,"order":10,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"This, that, these, those","seo":{"title":"This, that, these, those - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'this, that, these, those' in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1Grammar_This-That-These-Those.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T08:59:18","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences with <em>this, that, these, those</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"418\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose <em>this, that, these, those</em> to complete the following sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"419\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Transform singular sentences into plural sentences and plural sentences into singular sentences using <em>this, that, these, those</em> and other missing words.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: These are my books ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">This is</span> my book.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"420\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>This/these= here, that/those= there</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/this-that_these-those.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart with cartoon monsters illustrating the demonstratives 'this, that, these, those' in English, with 'here' and 'there' directional cues and example sentences.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10770\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h3>This, these (here)</h3> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>this</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>these</strong> for things that are <strong>here </strong>(near).&nbsp;<strong>This</strong> is singular and&nbsp;<strong>these</strong> is plural.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>This</strong></span> is my new watch.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>These</strong></span> are my sisters Anna and Jenny.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h3>That, those (there)</h3> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>that</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>those</strong> for things that are <strong>there&nbsp;</strong>(not near).&nbsp;<strong>That</strong>&nbsp;is singular and&nbsp;<strong>those</strong> is plural.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>That</strong></span>&nbsp;man is very strange.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I need <span><strong>those</strong></span> boxes over there.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h3>With a noun or without a noun</h3> <p>We can use <strong>this, that, these, those</strong> with a noun (<strong>this box, that car</strong>, etc.) or without a noun.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>This watch</strong></span> is very expensive.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I like <span><strong>that woman</strong></span> in the park.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>Who is <span><strong>that</strong></span>?&nbsp;</em>(= that person)</li> <li><em>‘What are <span><strong>those</strong></span>?’ ‘They are old pictures.’</em></li> </ul> <h3>This is John (introductions and <a href=\"/vocabulary/b1/phone-talk-b1-english-vocabulary/\">on the phone</a>)</h3> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>this is</strong> when we introduce people and on the telephone.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Hi, <strong><span>this is</span></strong> Tim.</em> (Tim on the telephone)</li> <li>Laura: <em>‘Hi, Sara. <span><strong>This is</strong> </span>my friend Paul.’</em> Sara: <em>‘Hi, Paul. Nice to meet you.’</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":418,"questions":[{"id":3605,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are my trousers. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["This","These"]}]},{"id":3606,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Hi, Chris. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is my friend Jona.' 'Hi, Jona. Nice to meet you.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["That","This"]}]},{"id":3607,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Look at <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> birds in the sky. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["these","those"]}]},{"id":3608,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'What are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?' 'They are my books.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["that","those"]}]},{"id":3609,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> hotel nice?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["those","that"]}]},{"id":3610,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your friends?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["these","this"]}]},{"id":3611,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Who is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> man over there?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["this","that"]}]},{"id":3612,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Isn't <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your friend Erik?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["these","this"]}]},{"id":3613,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Why are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> boxes here? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["those","these"]}]},{"id":3614,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are my glasses.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["That","These"]}]}]},{"id":419,"questions":[{"id":3616,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>'What's _____?' 'It's a calculator.' </div>","choices":[{"id":5743,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5744,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>these</span>"}]},{"id":3617,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>______ are John and Teresa. </div>","choices":[{"id":5745,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>This</span>"},{"id":5746,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>These</span>"}]},{"id":3618,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Hi, Richard, _____ is Julia. (On the phone)</div>","choices":[{"id":5747,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5748,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>that</span>"}]},{"id":3619,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Look at _____ cloud. It's very strange. </div>","choices":[{"id":5749,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5750,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>that</span>"}]},{"id":3620,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>'What are _____?' 'They are little cakes.'</div>","choices":[{"id":5751,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>that</span>"},{"id":5752,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>those</span>"}]},{"id":3621,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ are my keys.</div>","choices":[{"id":5753,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>That</span>"},{"id":5754,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Those</span>"}]},{"id":3622,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Is _____ your mother?</div>","choices":[{"id":5755,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5756,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>these</span>"}]},{"id":3623,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What is in _____ box over there?</div>","choices":[{"id":5757,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5758,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>that</span>"}]},{"id":3624,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ is my hand!</div>","choices":[{"id":5759,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>This</span>"},{"id":5760,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>That</span>"}]},{"id":3625,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ are my cats.</div>","choices":[{"id":5761,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>this</span>"},{"id":5762,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>those</span>"}]}]},{"id":420,"questions":[{"id":3626,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This is a flower ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> flowers. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3627,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>That is a box. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> boxes.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3628,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>That is my father. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> my parents. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3629,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Are those your friends? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your friend?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3630,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>What are those things? ⇒ What <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> thing?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3631,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>These documents are important. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> important. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3632,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Are these your shoes? ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your shoe?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3633,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>That's a good car. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> good cars. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3634,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This is John. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> John and Carla. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3635,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>These are cheap computers. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a cheap computer. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}